WEBVTT

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.760
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.370
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.020
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:11.410
In an attempt to kidnap the 
chefs, Gourmet Corp. attacked,

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:15.950
turning the Cooking Fest stadium 
into a fierce battleground.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:19.820
Chefs are treasures of 
the world, and its hope.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:24.190
The Four Kings put their own lives on 
the line as they try to protect them.

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:27.160
The battle demonstrates 
their individual strength

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.990
and how much they've improved.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:34.160
Hair Marionette.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.340
All of your nerves

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.200
belong to me.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:45.440
The End is Here! Sunny's Final Power!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.370
It can't be.

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:06.260
Not even one of your hairs 
has invaded my body.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:09.130
What do you mean about my nerves?!

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.350
The hair you're not used to...

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:16.640
You didn't mean the hair 
with the dangerous power

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:19.340
but the hair that was cut off?!

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.390
Even cut off, the nerves 
can communicate for a time,

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.500
just like insects' ganglia!

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:27.350
So you were remote-controlling them!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.820
I knew your left arm was still alive.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:36.430
You gave me the hint for this.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.530
I knew if I could just 
control my chopped off hair,

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.740
even if my enemy was several kilometers away,

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.870
I'd be able to get the drop 
on him without him noticing.

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.990
Then your control of that 
dangerous hair was unsteady

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:55.530
because you were focusing on 
controlling the severed hair?!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:57.320
What can I say? Still,

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:01.660
it is true that using this 
Satan Hair is painful.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.860
Even now. On top of that,

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.430
I'd better operate on this stomach soon.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.180
And so,

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.260
I think it's time to end this,

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:15.750
Vice-chef of Gourmet Corp., Tommyrod.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:20.450
Sunny of the Four Kings... It's strange.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.830
This battle with you

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:27.350
somehow makes me feel exhilarated, 
just like when I fought Toriko.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.150
Is that so? Actually, me too.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.830
When you were relying on the bugs,

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.390
I thought you were a disgusting bastard,

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:40.560
but not many people would charge 
at me with just their own body.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:44.090
And you're the first guy to

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.030
tear out so much of my hair.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.020
Right now, I'm still not 
able to maintain control

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.670
of my torn-out hair that long.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:54.910
You'll soon be able to move freely.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.000
You understand?

00:04:57.470 --> 00:05:01.110
That moment is the signal 
to "draw our swords".

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.960
My left arm

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.000
has already been eaten?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.700
I feel no hostility.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.070
As a matter of fact, I'm showing 
respect to my opponent.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.320
This feeling...

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.430
I don't think I've ever had it 'til now.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.880
I bet it's this hair.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.180
Neither good nor evil.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:39.990
This will be a savage showdown, 
free of resentment.

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:43.860
There's only one thing 
in a fight like this...

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:46.890
Feeding.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.600
That's the sole goal

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.400
of this demon!

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:24.420
Farewell...

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.710
...Tommyrod.

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:32.840
Yeah. I had a lot of fun.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:55.790
What I did

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.650
wasn't a beautiful way

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.090
to win at all.

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:03.000
After the stomach operation is over,

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.070
take a little break, idiot.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.380
Zebra-san did that!

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:25.410
Zebra-san, Coco-san, and Sunny-san

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.350
are going all out!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:32.010
They're doing it to protect us 
chefs and everyone else here!

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:35.200
And Toriko-san too!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.270
I'm sure you'll be alright.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:41.740
But there's no guarantee that I'll win.

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:44.890
I have to hurry!

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.600
What the...? I sense somethin' dangerous.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.300
Although that describes me, too.

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:07.570
What are you supposed to be?

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:13.170
I am Elg, Branch #1 Culinary 
Head of Gourmet Corp.

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:16.140
Sorry 'bout that.

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:19.580
But what, you think I'm 
gonna remember your name?

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.850
Wasted your time, dumbass.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.020
You're fast.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:35.810
Like lightning...

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:38.310
Do you generate electricity from your body?

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.400
How can he take my electric shock head on

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.970
and still be alive?!

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:46.510
I produce an average of 100 million 
volts and 100,000 amperes!

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:49.100
All of my cells are like amplifying circuits.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.470
That increases the power of my electricity!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:56.180
So you discharge the same amount of 
electricity as a lightning strike...

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:59.440
Synced Up Electric Chop!

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:06.110
His cells are fried, his 
heart and lungs stopped...

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.330
He should totally be dead.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.730
I dodged that swift attack,

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.470
but he still grazed me?

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.010
I thought that was going to be a hit.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.270
What the hell are you?

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:28.620
You must've died a minute ago!

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:31.850
I didn't finish introducing myself.

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:34.130
I am Elg,

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:37.590
Branch #1 Culinary Head of Gourmet Corp.

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:39.860
and the eldest chef.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.760
"Ever-young" Elg.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:42.960
Ever-young?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.430
Well, it does look like that 
burnt skin regenerated.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:50.970
My body doesn't and never will age.

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:53.480
As such, I won't die.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.220
It's probably hard to believe,

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.870
but my body is immortal.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.410
Immortal?

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.820
Is your head okay?

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:04.790
My lower half

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.550
belongs to the Horse King, Herc.

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:10.350
It's the ageless, immortal horse

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.940
that lives in the Gourmet World,

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.010
though is considered a 
mythical Beast of legend.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.110
That is my body.

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.360
Don't tell me you fused together?!

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.630
And with Herc, said to forbid anyone 
in the world to ride on its back!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:27.510
Our cells are quite compatible.

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:31.640
It's given me the power of immortality 
and is very comfortable as well.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.650
So you got an old-ass horse's ass.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:38.010
The second you combined with 
it, it stopped bein' legendary

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.920
and just became a rare Beast.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:46.310
You shouldn't be the one 
to call me a "rare Beast",

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:48.290
Brunch the tengu.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.930
Immortal, huh?

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:52.930
Well, I'll prove that wrong!

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:55.070
Lightning Knife!

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:58.040
Vortex Thunderstorm Dicer!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.240
Not quite immortal.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:06.340
Just regeneration of pluripotent cells...

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:13.310
Even the so-called "immortal jellyfish"

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.590
actually ages.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:18.160
Before its aged cells die,

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:21.830
it just copies itself, generating new bodies.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.730
But there's no way you'll be able to

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:27.300
regenerate after I've pulverized you.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.500
I've been alive for some 200 years.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:37.050
The longer I live and older I get,

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.110
it feels like time moves faster.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:45.130
If you live long, things that move 
you and new discoveries decrease

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.990
because you already know them.

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:52.860
Info you already know isn't stored in 
the brain as memories, but removed.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:56.450
And that even includes 
life-and-death battles.

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.570
No way!

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:05.000
It can't be...

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:08.240
I told you. I'm immortal.

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:11.030
All the pieces that I smashed him into

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:13.590
have regenerated into full bodies?!

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:37.840
Crap! Since I already used Lightning 
Knife, my batteries are...

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.400
Herc Kick!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.110
Brunch.

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:50.830
I'm sure I'll forget your name soon, too.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.940
And it seems this battle

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:58.020
didn't stimulate my brain at all either.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:00.960
Is that regenerative ability nou-darake?

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:02.280
Yes.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:05.920
The organism called a planarian 
has a certain gene.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:11.140
If a planarian is cut up, 
the pieces will regenerate.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.980
A new brain will form in each body,

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:17.000
thanks to the nou-darake 
gene regenerative ability.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.140
So if you get cut into pieces,

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.840
each piece becomes another body, huh?

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.450
Then before,

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.220
when you slashed my cheek,

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:30.770
you were already split up, weren't you?

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:34.160
That's a pretty damn dirty trick.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:40.280
A rat snuck in here.

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:42.760
Is it okay to kill it?

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.940
That kid's my chef.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:48.980
Let him live.

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:51.000
I'll take him with us.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.950
You know...

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:57.120
I feel badly for IGO President Ichiryu.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.290
The two people he sent to 
deal with Gourmet Corp.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:05.620
aren't actually on IGO 
or Gourmet Corp.'s side.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:11.620
The Utopia of New Food, NEO.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.960
The members of NEO

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:17.800
have infiltrated major organizations 
all over the world.

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:21.710
Including IGO and Gourmet Corp...

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.330
Currently,

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:27.000
Gourmet Corp. is making a comeback by 
throwing the Nitro into the battle.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:31.050
And I expect they'll be sending 
in more powerful Scum Beasts.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.200
But IGO also

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:35.700
has an ace up their sleeve.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.910
It can't be helped.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.300
Shall we have him intervene?

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:56.270
I just got word from Joie.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:59.710
It seems he's on his way here.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.020
Okay. I can generate a little.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:08.670
Maybe you are immortal, whatever... 
But strong or weak...

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.760
That's got nothin' to do 
with winning or losing!

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:13.770
I'm gonna teach you there are lots of people

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:16.290
in this world stronger than immortality!

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:18.500
Stronger than immortality?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.900
I haven't heard that line before.

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:24.360
Alright, Brunch...

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:27.140
Stimulate me more!

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:32.210
Step leader!

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.490
This is an electrical path!

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.250
200 kilometers a second, Mach 600!

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:40.690
The return stroke is the electric 
shock running down that path!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.570
Its speed is 10,000 kilometers a second.

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:44.560
That's Mach 30,000!

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.360
Lock on to all these bastards!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:50.660
Synced Up Electric Cutter!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:53.910
He turned electricity

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:55.370
into sharp blades!

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:59.340
But I bet the voltage is weak!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.510
Howling Lightning Kamaitachi!

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.990
Have you noticed?

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:11.980
My body's resistance to 
electricity is increasing.

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:14.170
Electric Knife!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.150
My immortal body is always 
learning and adapting.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.690
So I have slight superiority there.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:25.400
Also, your electricity has limits!

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:32.510
It seems

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.810
you're out of power.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:37.910
Your electricity requires 
an outside power source.

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:40.180
Otherwise, you can't amplify 
it inside your body.

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:43.610
I could tell just by looking 
at that, cheap batteries.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:48.020
If my batteries are out... 
all I gotta do is change 'em!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.250
You don't get it!

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:51.990
Right now, you can't use electric attacks!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:55.260
And I'm not gonna give you time 
to change batteries, half-wit!

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:01.290
I knew it would end like this.

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.610
Don't bother feeling shame.

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:06.870
This whole incident will be 
wiped from my memory soon.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.470
Br...

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:10.340
What's your name again?

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:13.010
Brunch the tengu!

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:17.160
Wind power, water power, 
thermal power, sunlight...

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:20.450
There are other ways to 
charge up besides batteries!

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.390
Your attacks too...

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:26.590
I turned all of their 
energy into electricity!

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:29.910
Thanks to that, I was able to generate a ton!

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:30.660
What?!

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:32.550
Locked on!

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:34.950
None of 'em can escape!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:38.400
Secret Technique: Wide-range 
Cascade Circuit Electrical Strike!

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.900
The part of the body that electricity 
flows through most is the blood.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:47.340
The reason I used Electric 
Cutter to chop you up

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:50.820
was to make you bleed and lower 
your electrical resistance!

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:54.820
I can regenerate again and again!

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.800
Let me tell you something.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.540
That electrical strike charges the target.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.750
Even if your cells regenerate,

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:03.960
that current will continue forever.

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:06.880
So go ahead and keep regeneratin'!

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:09.930
You'll spend the rest of your 
life bein' electrocuted!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:13.000
W-What?!

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.790
I told you.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.830
Winnin' or losin' has nothing 
to do with immortality.

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.050
Bastard...

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.450
Brunch the tengu!

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.510
Yeah, Brunch.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:29.820
Um, and what's your name again?

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:36.010
I guess when faced with 
eternal electrocution,

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.030
your Gourmet cells gave up on regeneratin'.

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:44.940
So that's the true form of 
your 200-year-old body...

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:48.990
Did you wrap your face in 
bandages yourself to hide it?

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:53.030
Revealing this form...

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:55.930
...would've made Midora-sama 
lose his appetite.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.380
