00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:21.010
Nah, you're totally normal-lookin'.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.010
In my village,

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:28.550
we got a mess of real monsters, 
like daruma, kappa, and oni.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:30.670
AIn't nothin' rare about Herc there.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.360
In fact, you'd be a handsome stud there.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.970
If the old daruma guy saw 
you, he'd be envious.

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:39.790
Now that guy's some kinda ugly!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.890
I'd be handsome there?

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:46.890
This is the first time I've heard

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.930
stimulating words like that.

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.050
Brunch...

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:56.690
Let me focus on those words...

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:59.810
...so in this moment in which I'm dying...

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:03.090
...I'll be able to remember 
them for eternity.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.280
Gourmet Corp...

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.280
Pains in the ass...

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:15.120
I'm beat. Better recharge soon.

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:25.070
Sound Armor!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.050
Almost...

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:30.830
I'm waitin' for ya...

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.410
